  (hierarchical_label "ADC_IN" (shape output) (at 246.38 114.3 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 2856040c-0d32-55de-b527-1fbfa09efe3c))
  (text "U201.5" (at 139.74 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4346612d-5b3a-5093-a406-4e49f6324869))
  (text "U201.2" (at 154.98 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left top)) (uuid ac05466e-173d-5f0c-ab79-db40b4d99c43))
  (text "U202.5" (at 170.22 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left top)) (uuid d0bcbd32-c7cb-52c6-b3ba-f3812f0a9449))
  (text "Decoupling: 100 nF X7R 0402 within 1 mm of each supply pin\n(U202 V- is GND). Bulk on the power sheet." (at 137.16 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid e438cc0c-8f99-5689-b2ab-54ad83096aab))
  (text "SAMPLER (sim/sampler/RESULT.md, SPEC decisions 1-3)\nGain hold/input 0.69, efficiency 69 % per strobe; 10-90 % 109 ps behind the BUF802 (65 ps ideal step).\nNoise ~0.35 mV rms at the bridge input after deconvolution; pedestal +49 mV (null with rail CM via DACs).\nSoftware: x_k = (v_k - 0.31 v_(k-1)) / 0.48 (calibrate per board). No bootstrap.\nADC trigger 40 ns after the strobe (any 0-212 ns settles), synchronous ADC clock; the ADC must sample\nBEFORE the S_STROBE falling edge (+160 ns): its reverse pulse shifts the hold by -13 mV (phase_array RESULT)." (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid d21b003b-2e2c-5f4c-b822-89f5762607fa))
  (text "INPUT LEG: R201 0402 within 3 mm of the BUF802 OUT pin;\nR201 -> bridge input <= 3 mm (~18 ps), 0.36 mm trace\nover solid L2 GND. BUF_OUT_S is the BUF802 OUT node\nitself (49.9 R trigger leg is on the input sheet).\nInput network rings for ideal edges: keep it short." (at 50.8 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5c3fdcef-a63b-5bfa-ac00-4d0412dd27a6))
  (text "STROBE: 50 % square from the balun (strobe sheet),\nshorted 80 ps stub -> ~130 ps pulse, 3 V class.\nSTRB_A drives the anode rail (+ pulse), STRB_K\nthe cathode rail (- pulse). Balun -> C201/C202\n<= 3 mm (~18 ps), 50 R, equal length (+/-0.1 mm);\nrail C mismatch 0.30/0.45 pF -> 30 mVpp kick at\nthe trigger end." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 27c9c219-62d3-5591-89bc-715e534a2ce0))
  (text "BRIDGE: D201/D202 BAT15-04W, mirror-symmetric,\nboth packages side by side, rails <= 2 mm.\nRectified charge 1.75 pC (A) / 1.38 pC (K) per\nstrobe; 47 pF rails recover in 47 ns.\nStrobe kick: 174 mVpp at bridge input,\n113 mVpp at BUF802 pin, 19 mVpp trigger end." (at 50.8 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0e45fb6e-936f-5141-9397-68500af296ae))
  (text "BIAS (mcu_if): VBIAS_A -0.50..-1.46 V (DAC/-2V5 divider,\n2.9k), VBIAS_K +0.2..+2.7 V (DAC via 5.1k): reverse-biases the\nbridge between strobes. 1 k x 47 pF: tau 47 ns.\n10 nF at the cold end of each 1 k feed." (at 137.16 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0199250a-7dcd-59d1-9bed-22cb8b7f5cf4))
  (text "HOLD NODE: C205 2.2 pF C0G + U201 Cin (1 pF CM) + pad.\nD202.3 -> C205 -> U201.3 < 2 mm, no via, no TP\n(leakage/C). Droop 1.25 % per 320 ns (model).\nU201: G = 1 + 1.00k/499 = +3.0 on +/-2.5 V:\n+/-0.35 V hold -> +/-1.04 V." (at 147.32 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 01de4ac7-a42a-527c-b01a-fd4d626ae1b4))
  (text "LEVEL SHIFT U202 (+3V3/GND):\nVadc = 2 x 0.725 V - V(U201) = 1.45 V - V(U201)\n-> 0.41..2.49 V at PA0. U201+U202 settle ~20 ns." (at 200.66 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid f503963a-922d-59c2-975f-5c785da07ece))
  (text "ADC PIN: R211 33 R + C207 220 pF C0G placed at\nJ701 pin 3 (mcu_if), PA0 ADC12_IN1, 6.5-cycle\n(108 ns) sampling at 60 MHz." (at 220.98 88.9 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 99a9cad7-c2c0-50b6-8ebd-5476951eb233))
